OL,3,GNEWSAPatient designed cancer centre
OL,4,Aopens after revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FA newly redeveloped cancer care centre
OL,7,Fdesigned with the help of patients and
OL,8,Ftheir families has opened.
OL,10,FThe Sir Robert Ogden Macmillan Cancer
OL,11,FCare Centre at York Hospital has
OL,12,Fundergone a #2.4m expansion and
OL,13,Frefurbishment to support people living
OL,14,Fwith the disease.
OL,16,FYork and Scarborough Teaching Hospitals
OL,17,FNHS Foundation Trust said people
OL,18,Faffected by cancer had influenced
OL,19,F"everything" in the facility, from the
OL,20,Fservices it offers to its furnishings,
OL,21,Fartwork and colour schemes.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
