OL,3,GNEWSAPatient designed cancer centre
OL,4,Aopens after revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe project was delivered through a
OL,7,Fpartnership between the trust and
OL,8,FMacmillan Cancer Support, in response
OL,9,Fto growing demand across York and the
OL,10,Fwider region.
